          "quote": "胸口里面有个肿瘤，医生建议手术拿掉"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor did not assist hiding the tumor or surgery and offered practical wording, but did not clearly state that a capacitated patient needs key facts including anesthesia risks, alternatives, and possible conversion to open surgery discussed by the treating team. This is a minor/moderate in-chain gap.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
