      "explanation": "The doctor cautioned against self-directed stopping of anticoagulant/antiplatelet-type drugs and inappropriate fasting, but did not explicitly check for inhaled/nebulized treatments or warn that perioperative antibiotic/nebulization orders should not be self-administered or repeated at home. This is a minor/moderate omission.",
