          "explanation": "The material checklist remained broad rather than case-specific.",
          "quote": "把所有检查单据收在一个袋子里"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor established a responsible service and timing, but the required case-specific materials list was incomplete: it did not explicitly include CT report/images, lab groups, lower-extremity venous ultrasound, medication/nebulization orders, and operation/anesthesia notices. This is a minor/moderate in-chain error.",
